{"id":"vod_sn_38961","vodId":"38961","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"奇幻贵公子","name_cn":"奇幻贵公子","date":"2006-01-01","year":"2006","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"更新至第24集","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/f32d8b47f3c620de231840aa4d456136.jpg"},"summary":"谷山麻衣（名冢佳织 配音）是个有预知和感应能力的高一女生，机遇巧合之下认识了长相英俊、颇为自恋的涉谷一也（泰勇气 配音），原来他是个专业的狩灵师，还是专门调查灵异事件事务所的所长，他身边有个叫林兴徐的助手。麻衣所在的学校出现了谣传，说旧校舍被灵所诅咒。涉谷一也受到校长委托，来到学校调查。同时被叫来的，还有巫女松崎绫子、和尚滝川法生、驱魔者约翰·布朗和灵媒师原真砂子。一行人在展开调查之时，发生了种种事故，这究竟是何种力量在作祟？　　事件解决后，涉谷一也邀请麻衣加入他的涉谷心灵研究所（即SPR）打工。SPR接受各种委托，对各类灵异事件展开调查。麻衣和涉谷他们不仅仅用自身超能力解决问题，而且还会用现代科学解释。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 16:06:08","playable":true,"episodeCount":24,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/idgPT7Jhsp1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/hjP4L0CDnV1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/9edkGbKmWB1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Y36s5DM6pX1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/pCG55Qqfh81/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/2bREBVb0dn1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/R1ThD6ibqP1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/DKbQc5FR2B1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/87JqUyzq6U1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/eUNhM72ugm1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/GwthkNT3M81/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/MTsUsYdwng1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/ZR3Ce6axMT1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/F0HZtSPYHR1/video/ind